                                "sense_id": "cf1deb5c-4c1c-3806-9fdd-09fd955cd564",
                                "text": "I will give unto him that is athirst of the fountain of the water of life freely.",
                                "translation": "我要將生命泉的水白白賜給那口渴的人喝。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f797393f-0850-42a7-b742-f5a68b5652fe",
                                "sense_id": "cf1deb5c-4c1c-3806-9fdd-09fd955cd564",
                                "text": "To this extenuated spectre, perhaps, a crumb is not thrown once a year; but when ahungered and athirst to famine—when all humanity has forgotten the dying tenant of a decaying house—Divine Mercy remembers the mourner, […]",
                                "translation": "對於這個消瘦的幽靈，或許一年也得不到一點碎屑；但當他飢腸轆轆、渴至極點時——當全人類都忘記了這棟破屋中垂死的房客時——神聖的慈悲仍會記得這位哀悼者， […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "61e5fa59-156d-368e-9221-b965d07d502c",
                        "entry_id": "a295b0bd-54ae-3a12-87ef-16662f8edf4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "渴望的，渴求的（常接 for）。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7596bb47-8807-4e84-b69d-106fffcf41d2",
                                "sense_id": "61e5fa59-156d-368e-9221-b965d07d502c",
                                "text": "I, that forever feel athirst for glory,\nCould at this moment be content to lie\nMeekly upon the grass, as those whose sobbings\nWere heard of none beside the mournful robins.",
                                "translation": "我，永遠感到對榮耀的渴望，\n此刻卻甘心躺臥在\n草地上，像那些嗚咽聲\n除了憂傷的知更鳥外無人聽見的人一樣。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e403538-20a8-4c6a-8276-e2126f48723e",
                                "sense_id": "61e5fa59-156d-368e-9221-b965d07d502c",
                                "text": "O sleepless heart and sombre soul unsleeping,\nThat were athirst for sleep and no more life\nAnd no more love, for peace and no more strife!",
                                "translation": "喔，失眠的心與不眠的憂鬱靈魂，\n那是對睡眠的渴求，不再留戀生命，\n不再留戀愛，只求和平，不再有鬥爭！"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdd7139e-fbee-4b7d-8401-38f4443000e6",
                                "sense_id": "61e5fa59-156d-368e-9221-b965d07d502c",
                                "text": "I am restless. I am athirst for far-away things.\nMy soul goes out in a longing to touch the skirt of the dim distance.",
                                "translation": "我坐立難安。我渴望著遠方的物事。我的靈魂在渴望中飄向遠方，想要觸碰那朦朧地平線的裙襬。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
